{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07793","headline":"同卢明府早秋宴张郎中海亭 · 孟浩然","name":"同卢明府早秋宴张郎中海亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侧听弦歌宰，文书游夏徒。\n故园欣赏竹，爲邑幸来苏。\n华省曾联事，仙舟复与俱。\n欲知临泛久，荷露渐成珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}